  "notes": "Warm off-white/cream newsprint palette with deep teal primary and terracotta for 'waiting on you' urgency. Source avatars are colored rounded squares with serif initials (DP, DF, AR). Unread messages are outlined in a golden-yellow border with a yellow dot next to the timestamp. Messages show the sender's local time ('8:41 AM his time') and per-message read receipts ('Seen by Samira', 'Karim listened', 'Samira hasn't seen this yet'). Voice notes include automatic transcripts with show more/less. Right panel 'Dates to know' uses calendar-leaf date chips (month in red caps over large day number) with add-to-calendar; 'Earlier on this story' is a vertical dotted timeline with 'You are here' highlighted card. 'Samira's view' button previews the conversation at the grandmother's large text size — accessibility-aware design for an elderly member. Read article tab (verified live) swaps panel to serif article reader with 'Select any sentence to quote it in your reply'."
